--- !u!114 &832027942
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 832027940}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6dcf75fcb66292c4091b5dc344601655, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcTalk
  speaker: HOODED TRAVELLER
  promptText: TALK
  lines:
  - So you're the one the lamps keep turning toward. I followed the light down.
  - Past that seal is the Crucible. The machine guarding it was built to keep a Crimson
    Core from leaving. It still is.
  - It doesn't hate you. It has one instruction left. Most things down here are like
    that.
  - Somewhere far below, someone decided the only answer was to lock all of it away.
    Forever. I'm not sure they were wrong.
  repeatLines:
  - One instruction left. Don't give it a reason.
  radius: 2.6
  facePlayer: 1
  model: {fileID: 1626826388}
