  - Hold there. ...Hm. You came down the old lift. Nothing comes down that lift any
    more.
  - "I strip Corestone out of dead machines. Violet, mostly \u2014 clean, quiet stuff.
    Keeps a fire going."
  - Further in it isn't violet. The Crimson got into the walls when the Collapse
    hit. It grows up through the floor like rot.
  - That suit of yours... the lamps leaned toward you when you walked in. Corestone
    doesn't do that. Not for anyone.
  - If you go deeper, keep to the light. Some of the workers never stopped working.
    They just stopped being workers.
  repeatLines:
  - Keep to the light.
  - The deep halls still run. Nobody ever told the machines to stop.
  radius: 2.6
  facePlayer: 0
  model: {fileID: 523950277}
